ed to view or modify the properties of various objects such as tables, queries, fields, forms, reports, data access pages, and controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="147179">property sheet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496195">ગુણધર્મ પત્રક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10241_232395_1944683"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that allows you to block a language encoding or character set in order to filter out unwanted international email messages that display in a language you don't understand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232395">Blocked Encodings List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944683">અવરોધિત એન્કોડિંગ્સ સૂચી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10245_35554_495442"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A string of text written in the command language and passed to the command interpreter for execution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="35554">command line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495442">આદેશ પંક્તિ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termN