s for the location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145137">network location</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785799">નેટવર્ક સ્થાન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14211_213519_2641024"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An order for a SKU that is currently not available for delivery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="213519">pre-order</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641024">પ્રી-ઑર્ડર કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14216_397178_1957183"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of recipients that are created to expedite the mass emailing of messages and other information. When email is sent to a mail-enabled universal distribution group, all members of that list receive a copy of the message. Mail-enabled universal distribution groups cannot be used to assign permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397178">mail-enabled universal distribution group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1957183">મેલ-સક્ષમ વૈશ્વિક સુરક્ષા સમૂહ</term><termNote type="geographicalUs