 solutions, projects, and files, as well as access to the commands that pertain to them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="719746">Solution Explorer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1976933">સમાધાન એક્સપ્લોરર</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2023_136809_496099"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A link that specifies a full path to a resource, such that the destination of the link doesn’t change based on where it is linking from.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136809">absolute link</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496099">ચોક્કસ લિંક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20243_721657_1856842"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A drop-down button that performs a default action and can also expand to a list of other possible actions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="721657">split button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1856842">વિભાજન બટન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">N