sic, on a single card. This device is sometimes treated as a bus that can be enumerated to locate the devices on that bus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="781514">multifunction device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1215527">મલ્ટિફંક્શન ડિવાઇસ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21948_781515_1215527"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of hardware that supports multiple discrete capabilities, such as audio, mixer, and music, on a single card. This device is sometimes treated as a bus that can be enumerated to locate the devices on that bus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="781515">MFD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1215527">મલ્ટિફંક્શન ડિવાઇસ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21951_1080693_1215528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To expose a virtual disk to the user, backed by a file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1080693">attach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1215528">જોડો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partO