es, charts, slicers or a named range of cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1644672">named item view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1857186">નામિત આઇટમ દ્રશ્ય</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2923_59620_495630"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of specifying software behavior by system administrators. Administrators set policies that are used to control how software features behave.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="59620">Group Policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495630">સમૂહ નીતિ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29256_1506853_2308680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for items that have been deleted from a first-stage Recycle Bin. Items in a second-stage Recycle Bin are visible only to site collection administrators.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506853">second-stage Recycle Bin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2308680">દ્વિતીય-તબક્કાનું રીસાઇકલ બિન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Nou