essors and successors to the task that is selected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1637192">task path</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1857162">કાર્ય પાથ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32157_1637193_1857163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A streamlined process for sharing Office documents with others.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1637193">simplified sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1857163">સરળીકૃત સહિયારીકરણ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32160_1637588_1857164"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that converts a PDF file to flowing text and document elements that are native to the application being used.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1637588">PDF reflow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1857164">PDF પુનર્પ્રવાહ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id