 means of having concurrent calls on PBX.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1814024">channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2065588">ચૅનલ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33712_1814027_2065643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables making and receiving Skype calls via a PBX system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1814027">Skype Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2065643">Skype Connect</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33713_1814225_2065593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A phone number allocated for the Skype user, allowing the user to call pre-configured landlines or mobile phones. A type of Skype To Go number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1814225">Direct Dial number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2065593">ડાયરેક્ટ ડાયલ નંબર</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">N