 have been stacked together in the Photos app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2106699">unstack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2186818">અનસ્ટેક કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37054_2781063_2782324"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The limited-day trial for government organizations for the offer for OneDrive for Business that includes Office Online, and that is hosted in the commercial cloud environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781063">OneDrive for Business with Office on the web (Government Pricing) Trial</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2782324">વેબ પર Office ની સાથે OneDrive for Business (સરકારી સંસ્થાઓ માટેની કિંમત)ની અજમાયશ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3706_146703_1856600"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The calendar selected in the regional settings in Windows Control Panel, or the system calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="146703">primary calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1856600">મુખ્ય કૅલેન્ડર</term><term