o send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353671">પ્રતિક્રિયા હબ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40502_2353113_2353673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that consumers can use to send feedback to the Windows team, to check for responses to that feedback, and to get news about the latest updates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353113">Feedback Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353673">Windows પ્રતિક્રિયા હબ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40503_2353114_2353669"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of settings that admins can use to manage files and operating system settings on enterprise-owned devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353114">enterprise control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353669">એન્ટરપ્રાઇઝ કન્ટ્રોલ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40504_2353123_2353672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The modern implementation of Windows PowerShell built on .NET Core. It includes a command-line shell, scripting language, and automation engine, providing IT administrators comprehensive control and automation of system administration tasks across multiple platforms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353123">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353672">PowerShell Core</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40511_2353386_2354052"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The group of add-ons for Office 2016 that includes one or more of the following: proofing tools, an LIP, a language pack, and/or a spellchecker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353386">Office 2016 Language Accessory Pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354052">Office 2016 Language Accessory Pack</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40521_2353984_2354560"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A free feature that allows setting up online business meetings using work email. The feature is part of Skype for Business experience and has multiple online entry-points (e.g. Skype.com).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2353984">Skype Meetings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354560">Skype મીટિંગ્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40523_2354097_2355248"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Big Data Analysis Generic Enabler reference implementation (GEri) intended to deploy means for analyzing both batch and stream data and get insights on such a data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354097">Cosmos</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2355248">કોસ્મોસ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40524_2354098_2355251"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A query expressed in the native SQL dialect of the database of choice.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354098">native database query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="23