ed to your clipboard into the address bar and takes you to the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373341">Paste and go</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374492">પેસ્ટ કરો અને જાઓ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_2373342_2374493"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373342">Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374493">ઝડપી સહાય</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_2373342_3160701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2373342">Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160701">Microsoft ક્વિક આસિસ્ટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_3160521_2374493"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160521">Microsoft Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374493">ઝડપી સહાય</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41921_3160521_3160701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app included in Windows that allows a trusted friend or support professional to help solve a problem with your PC by accessing and taking control of it over a remote connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160521">Microsoft Quick Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3160701">Microsoft ક્વિક આસિસ્ટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41931_2374260_2377912"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that allows users to create a pictorial table of contents containing a collection of their Section Zooms and that can update if the presentation is edited.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374260">Summary Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377912">સારાંશ ઝૂમ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41932_2374261_2377911"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a slide in a presentation which auto-updates when the slide is updated and navigates users to that slide when they click on the preview</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374261">Slide Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377911">સ્લાઇડ ઝૂમ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41933_2374264_2377910"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a section in a presentation which auto-updates when the section’s first slide is updated, navigates users to that section when they click on the preview, and returns them back to the Summary Zoom when they are done.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374264">Section Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377910">વિભાગ ઝૂમ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41938_2374322_2513468"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that teachers can use to provision student PCs for classroom use.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374322">Set up School PCs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513468">સેટ અપ સ્કૂલ પીસીઝ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41939_2374323_2513470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The education app used for secure, online assessments, such as exams. It doesn't allow test takers to access resources stored on their device or the internet; it prevents OS-level distractions; and it doesn't allow test-takers to share test content with other students.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374323">Take a Test</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513470">ટેક અ ટેસ્ટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41946_2375030_2378256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for games that are rented most over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375030">Most rented games</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378256">સૌથી વધુ ભાડે આપેલ રમતો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41947_2375031_2378255"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for apps that are rented most over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375031">Most rented apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378255">સૌથી વધુ ભાડે આપેલ એપ્લિકેશન્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41948_2375032_2378254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for apps or games that are rented most over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375032">Most rented</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378254">સૌથી વધુ ભાડે આપેલ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41949_2375033_2378249"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for games that are in the top 1000 items based on sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375033">Best selling games</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378249">શ્રેષ્ઠ વેચાતી રમતો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41950_2375034_2378248"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for apps that are in the top 1000 items based on sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375034">Best selling apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378248">શ્રેષ્ઠ વેચાતી એપ્લિકેશન્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41951_2375035_2378252"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for apps that are selected based on downloads, usage, and revenue over a 7-day period and ranks them according to those metrics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375035">Most popular apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378252">સૌથી વધુ લોકપ્રિય એપ્લિકેશન્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41952_2375036_2378253"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for games that are selected based on downloads, usage, and revenue over a 7-day period and ranks them according to those metrics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375036">Most popular games</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378253">સૌથી વધુ લોકપ્રિય રમતો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41953_2375037_2378258"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for games that were recently added to the Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375037">New games</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378258">નવી રમતો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41954_2375038_2378257"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for apps that were recently added to the Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375038">New apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378257">નવી એપ્લિકેશન્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41955_2375039_2378251"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for the games that are played the most by Store customers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375039">Most played games</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378251">સૌથી વધુ રમાયેલી રમતો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41956_2375040_2378250"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for the apps that are played the most by Store customers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375040">Most played apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378250">સૌથી વધુ ચલાવેલી એપ્લિકેશન્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41957_2375041_2378259"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person who informally represents their feature team by sharing their expertise with the community in activities such as listening and responding to customer feedback, contributing to community forums, blogging about tips and tricks, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375041">community champion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378259">સમુદાય ચેમ્પિયન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41957_2751151_2378259"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person who informally represents their feature team by sharing their expertise with the community in activities such as listening and responding to customer feedback, contributing to community forums, blogging about tips and tricks, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2751151">community champ</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2378259">સમુદાય ચેમ્પિયન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4196_213534_496401"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of colors or levels of gray that can be displayed at one time. The amount or memory in the computer's graphics controller card controls the display. An 8-bit controller can display 256 colors or levels of gray; a 16-bit controller, 64,000 colors; and a 24-bit controller, 16.8 million colors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="213534">bit specification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496401">બિટ વિશિષ્ટીકરણ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41961_2375458_3113814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The basic amount of the guaranteed ingress/egress of events sent to an Event Hub that can be dynamically scaled according to stream processing, to pay only for compute needs and handle jobs with gigabytes/sec of streamed data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375458">capacity unit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113814">કેપેસિટી યુનિટી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41961_2766779_3113814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The basic amount of the guaranteed ingress/egress of events sent to an Event Hub that can be dynamically scaled according to stream processing, to pay only for compute needs and handle jobs with gigabytes/sec of streamed data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766779">CU</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113814">કેપેસિટી યુનિટી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4197_113668_495955"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A power-saving state that allows the computer or device to quickly resume full-power operation (typically within several seconds) when you want to start working again. All open documents and programs are saved to memory before the computer or device enters the low-power state.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="113668">sleep</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495955">સ્લીપ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4197_113668_496845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A power-saving state that allows the computer or device to quickly resume full-power operation (typically within several seconds) when you want to start working again. All open documents and programs are saved to memory before the computer or device enters the low-power state.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="113668">sleep</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lan