 is drawing with a stylus before the stylus has been lifted up.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2410901">wet ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416510">વેટ ઇંક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42569_2411210_2416499"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink that results after the user has drawn with a stylus and has lifted up the stylus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411210">dry ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416499">ડ્રાય ઇંક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42570_2411211_2416500"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink whose thickness and color can be changed even after drying.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411211">editable ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416500">સંપાદનયોગ્ય ઇંક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42571_2411212_2416502"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink that is retained as dry ink and not converted to a command.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411212">ink as ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416502">ઇંક તરીકે ઇંક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42572_2411213_2416505"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ink whose look resembles a #2 pencil.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2411213">pencil ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2416505">પેન્સિલ ઇંક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42607_2413500_2420845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office button that launches a task pane where users can research papers by typing queries to get information such as sources, citations, quotes, and images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413500">Researcher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2420845">સંશોધક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42608_2413506_2420846"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office feature that allows users type queries and find information, sources, citations, quotes, and images, without leaving the application that they are using.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413506">Researcher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2420846">સંશોધક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42614_2414369_2417542"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">T​o quickly return to an app, website, or document you were using earlier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414369">jump back</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2417542">પાછા જમ્પ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42615_2414370_2417543"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of documents, apps, and websites that, in one click, allows you to pick up your work exactly where you left it earlier, on any device connected with the same Microsoft account.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414370">jump group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2417543">જમ્પ સમૂહ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42616_2414371_2417541"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To quickly jump to a document or application on another device that is connected to the same Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414371">jump</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2417541">જમ્પ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42617_2414373_2417544"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets customers reset their network settings back to the Windows defaults.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414373">network reset</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2417544">નેટવર્ક રીસેટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42639_2414859_2417545"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control that contains a customizable and extensible collection of ink-related features for Universal Windows apps. By default, the toolbar may include buttons for drawing, erasing, highlighting, setting ink color and stroke thickness, and displaying a ruler.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414859">Windows Ink toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2417545">Windows Ink ઉપકરણ પટ્ટી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42642_2414869_2530794"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To move the camera forward or backwards, to zoom in and out the 3D object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2414869">zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2530794">ઝૂમ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42643_2415081_2489869"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 app that allows users to submit timesheets and report progress on tasks tracked in Project Online.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415081">Office 365 Project Time Reporter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489869">Office 365 Project Time Reporter</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42643_2415081_2489870"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 app that allows users to submit timesheets and report progress on tasks tracked in Project Online.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415081">Office 365 Project Time Reporter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489870">Time Reporter</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42643_2415082_2489869"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 app that allows users to submit timesheets and report progress on tasks tracked in Project Online.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415082">Time Reporter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489869">Office 365 Project Time Reporter</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42643_2415082_2489870"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 app that allows users to submit timesheets and report progress on tasks tracked in Project Online.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415082">Time Reporter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489870">Time Reporter</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42644_2415086_2489871"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 Project Time Reporter view that allows user to manage and record how they spend their personal and work time during a given week.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415086">Timesheet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489871">Timesheet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42645_2415869_2420843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The context menu that pops up when text is selected in the Researcher panel giving the option of adding the selected text only or adding the selected text and a citation for the text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415869">Add Cite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2420843">ઉદ્ધરણ ઍડ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4265_101189_495910"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database repository for information about a computer's configuration. The registry contains information that Windows continually references during operation, such as: profiles for each user; the programs installed on the computer and the types of documents that each can create; property settings for folders and program icons; what hardware exists on the system; which ports are being used. The registry is organized hierarchically as a tree, and it is made up of keys and their subkeys, hives, and entries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="101189">registry</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495910">રજિસ્ટ્રી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4265_1167347_495910"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database repository for information about a computer's configuration. The registry contains information that Windows continually references during operation, such as: profiles for each user; the programs installed on the computer and the types of documents that each can create; property settings for folders and program icons; what hardware exists on the system; which ports are being used. The registry is organized hierarchically as a tree, and it is made up of keys and their subkeys, hives, and entries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167347">s