d to control an on-screen cursor for such actions as "pressing" on-screen buttons in dialog boxes, choosing menu items, and selecting ranges of cells in spreadsheets or groups of words in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="93293">pointing device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495871">પોઇંટિંગ ડિવાઇસ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44809_2521577_2523955"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel add-in that finds functions needed to transform and format data when the user gives it examples of the desired output.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521577">Transform Data by Example</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523955">Transform Data by Example</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4481_1133582_1995975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that allows users to connect remotely to a computer and access programs, files, and network resources as though they were sitting at the computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1133582">RD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:la