, System Administrator, and IT).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2570254">Microsoft Education Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2955284">Education Analytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45589_2570254_2955303"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app in Office 365 Education SKUs that provides data aggregation, analytics, dashboards, and reporting to education personas (Students, Teachers, Parents, System Administrator, and IT).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2570254">Microsoft Education Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2955303">Microsoft Education Analytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45589_2570255_2955284"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app in Office 365 Education SKUs that provides data aggregation, analytics, dashboards, and reporting to education personas (Students, Teachers, Parents, System Administrator, and IT).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2570255">Education Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2955284">Education Analytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45589_2570255_2955303"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app in Office 365 Education SKUs that provides data aggregation, analytics, dashboards, and reporting to education personas (Students, Teachers, Parents, System Administrator, and IT).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2570255">Education Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2955303">Microsoft Education Analytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45591_2570262_2573457"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The methodology, originally developed in the Japanese automotive industry, that uses digital cards to achieve just-in-time delivery and manage the replenishment cycle in a manufacturing process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2570262">Kanban</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573457">કાનબાન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4561_319151_496967"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The " character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319151">straight quotation mark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496967">સરળ અવતરણ ચિહ્ન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4565_31042_1766693"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of finalizing a purchase on a website. For example, when customers shop on your website, they may select several items and save them in their shopping basket. When they have finished shopping, they click on a checkout link or graphical button that takes them to an online form where they enter their name, billing address, payment type, and shipping information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="31042">checkout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1766693">ચેકઆઉટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4566_118879_495991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu that contains commands you can use to manipulate a window or close a program. You click the program icon at the left of the title bar to open this menu. The context menu of a window replaces this menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="118879">system menu</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495991">નિયંત્રણ મેનૂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4566_118880_495991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu that contains commands you can use to manipulate a window or close a program. You click the program icon at the left of the title bar to open this menu. The context menu of a window replaces this menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="118880">control menu</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495991">નિયંત્રણ મેનૂ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4567_232422_1856681"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The container in a navigation pane that contains shortcuts and shortcut groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232422">Shortcuts Pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1856681">શૉર્ટકટ્સ ફલક</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45689_2575485_2578415"><langSet x