ecognition.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2607094">enhanced sign-in security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609051">વધારેલ સાઇન ઇન સુરક્ષા</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46293_2607097_2609052"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The capability of Windows Defender System Guard that protects a device from compromised firmware.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2607097">firmware protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609052">ફર્મવેર સુરક્ષા</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46294_2607107_2609054"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The consumer-friendly name for trusted platform module (TPM)​.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2607107">security processor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609054">સુરક્ષા પ્રોસેસર</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46299_2607706_2609053"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows 10 app that helps users get online easily and in more places on their Windows 10 PC. Users sign up for a data plan and connect with mobile operators in their area using a supported SIM card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2607706">Mobile Plans</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609053">મોબાઇલ પ્લાન્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="463_75391_495737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that is inserted into a document from a source file and that is updated when the original source file is updated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="75391">linked object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495737">લિંક કરેલ ઑબ્જેક્ટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4631_158674_1215218"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu for a group of ready-made shapes that includes basic shapes, such as rectangles and circles, plus a variety of lines and connectors, block arrows, flowchart symbols, stars and banners, and callouts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="158674">AutoShapes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1215218">ઓટોશૅપ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46310_2608183_2610140"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A web part that is offered as default for the design of a SharePoint communication site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2608183">default hero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610140">ડિફૉલ્ટ હીરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46325_2608792_2610139"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint site created or managed by few people to broadcast information out to a broad audience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2608792">communication site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610139">સંચાર સાઇટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46330_2609539_2663789"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that enables Cortana to take over your mouse pointer and literally show you how to change a setting when you ask her to "show me (how to do something)." She performs each step for you in a sequence of clicks needed to make a particular change in Windows Settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609539">Cortana Show Me</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2663789">Cortana Show Me</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46337_2609835_2787213"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To plan an event for a specific time slot.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609835">schedule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2787213">શેડ્યૂલ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46341_2610077_2611076"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The consumer-facing name for Hypervisor Code Integrity (HVCI). The HVCI service in Windows 10 determines whether code executing in kernel mode is securely designed and trustworthy, and helps ensure that all software running in kernel mode, including drivers, securely allocate memory and operate as they are intended.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610077">memory integrity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2611076">સ્મૃતિ અખંડિતતા</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2837191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837191">Microsoft OneDrive Sync</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2837192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837192">OneDrive Sync</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834960_2837191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834960">OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837191">Microsoft OneDrive Sync</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834960_2837192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834960">OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2837192">OneDrive Sync</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_318145_495705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of keys that must be pressed sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318145">access key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495705">કી અનુક્રમ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_318145_496905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of keys that must be pressed sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318145">access key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496905">ઍક્સેસ કી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_72848_495705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of keys that must be pressed sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72848">key sequence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495705">કી અનુક્રમ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4635_72848_496905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any combination of keys that must be pressed sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72848">key sequence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496905">ઍક્સેસ કી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46350_2611867_3044253"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to provide and control their own encryption keys used to encrypt their Microsoft data at rest.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2611867">Customer Key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3044253">Microsoft Purview કસ્ટમર કી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46350_3043787_3044253"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables customers to provide and control their own encryption keys used to encrypt their Microsoft data at rest.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3043787">Microsoft Purview Customer Key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3044253">Microsoft Purview કસ્ટમર કી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46353_2612185_2612919"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The consumer-friendly name for virtualization-based security (VBS). The VBS service in Windows 10 uses hardware virtualization features to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612185">Core isolation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612919">કોર પૃથકત્વ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46354_2612186_2612920"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of open tabs, including applications, files, pages, or websites, which can be saved together and re-opened together when you want to continue with that set of tabs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612186">set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612920">સેટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46375_2612854_2924084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A date when Microsoft will no longer provide updates to a feature release of a product, such that a customer needs to upgrade to a new feature release to continue receiving support from Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612854">end of service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2924084">સેવાનો અંત</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46375_2878237_2924084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A date when Microsoft will no longer provide updates to a feature release of a product, such that a customer needs to upgrade to a new feature release to continue receiving support from Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2878237">EOL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2924084">સેવાનો અંત</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128246_3129336"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128246">App Control for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129336">ઍપ નિયંત્રણ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128246_3129341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128246">App Control for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129341">વ્યવસાય માટે ઍપ નિયંત્રણ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128314_3129336"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128314">App Control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129336">ઍપ નિયંત્રણ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128314_3129341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128314">App Control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3129341">વ્યવસાય માટે ઍપ નિયંત્રણ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4639_108282_495928"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To move a document or other data in a window in order to view a particular portion of the document. Scrolling may be controlled by the mouse, arrow keys, or other keys on the keyboard, eventually with one or more fingers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="108282">scroll</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495928">સ્ક્રોલ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46410_2613241_2805384"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A team in Microsoft Teams that is available for all users in an organization to join.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2613241">public team</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2805384">સાર્વજનિક ટીમ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</t