d experiences from anywhere – on any device – through mixed reality applications; the app for Hololens that lets people connect, share, and collaborate in mixed reality that runs on that service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000152">Mesh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000250">Microsoft Mesh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="528_67425_495672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The location where the user is currently directing input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="67425">input focus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495672">ઇનપુટ ફોકસ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52810_3001101_3001543"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Microsoft Teams for Education that allows educators to quickly and easily communicate with their students’ parents and guardians.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3001101">Parents</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3001543">પેરેન્ટ્સ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun<