s a lot of available space on their screen and displays all other open windows as thumbnails, allowing the user to choose which other window they want to occupy the available space.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3030414">Snap Assist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031091">સ્નૅપ આસિસ્ટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53197_3030416_3031090"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that allows users to customize settings for their Microsoft accessories.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3030416">Microsoft Accessory Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031090">Microsoft એસેસરી સેન્ટર</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53213_3031665_3031951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A form of online advertising in which paid ads are displayed among search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031665">search advertising</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031951">શોધ જાહેરાત</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</ter