9"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Teams add-on license that allows offices to designate devices as shared devices, including common area phones, Teams displays for hot-desks, and Teams panels for meeting spaces.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127759">Teams Shared Devices</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128369">Teams શેર કરાયેલ ડિવાઇસેસ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55170_3127858_3128366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Viva Goals, to pass on OKRs from one level to the next, allowing employees and teams to see how their work directly contributes to the ultimate goals of their organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3127858">cascade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128366">કાસ્કેડ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55171_3128244_3129343"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service in Windows, available through Azure, that adds digital signatures to application binaries and packages, and thereby providing security promises of authenticity and integrity used to establish trust in software that you are distributing.</descrip></descripGrp>