cted</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56087_3153852_3153959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT Admins to enable their organization's branding assets from Entra onto profile-related UI for profiles signed in with an Entra ID account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153852">organization branding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153959">ઓર્ગેનાઈઝેશન બ્રાન્ડિંગ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56088_3153853_3153953"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that, based on a prompt entered by the user, creates custom images formatted as an Edge theme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153853">custom theme</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153953">કસ્ટમ થીમ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56089_3153855_3153961"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables the user, when writing in the browser, to use generative AI to reword their written text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153855">rewrite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote typ