ication of the performance capability of your computer's hardware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234820">system rating</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496502">સિસ્ટમ રેટિંગ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6484_136942_1428445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A ready-made button that the user can insert into his/her presentation and define hyperlinks for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136942">action button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1428445">ક્રિયા બટન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6486_310254_496826"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity at one end of a point-to-point LAN/WLAN segment that is requesting authenticated access to the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="310254">supplicant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496826">સપ્લિકેન્ટ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6490_183384_2186634"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An agreement between two owners to promote content in different places.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183384">affiliate marketing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2186634">સહયોગી માર્કેટિંગ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6502_315144_496861"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A word, symbol, or other group of characters used to identify a file, a storage medium, an element defined in a computer program, or a specific item in a document such as a spreadsheet or a chart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="315144">label</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496861">લેબલ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6507_130126_496050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of measures to protect a machine from being infected by a virus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="130126">virus protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496050">વાયરસ સુરક્ષા</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6513_45147_495512"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any piece of equipment that can be attached physically or wirelessly to a network or computer, for example, printers, keyboards, external disk drives, or other peripheral equipment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="45147">device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495512">ડિવાઇસ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6514_397180_1957187"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Settings that are applied to the managed folders in users' mailboxes to control the retention and journaling of messages for messaging records management (MRM). Managed content settings define when messages that are no longer needed are to be removed or journaled (copied) to a separate storage location outside the mailbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397180">managed content settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1957187">મેનેજ કરેલ કસ્ટમ ફોલ્ડર</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6516_50772_495576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of turning data into a stream of bits. Encoding is part of the serialization process that converts data into a stream of ones and zeros.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50772">encoding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495576">એન્કોડિંગ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6520_91124_495851"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect created by simple, repeating designs such as vertical or horizontal lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="91124">pattern</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495851">નમૂનો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6533_62030_1415584"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A postal address at which a person is normally resident.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62030">home address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1415584">ઘરનું સરનામું</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6538_360134_497154"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that shows a graphical analysis of data in a datasheet or form. You can see different levels of detail or specify the layout by dragging fields and items or by showing and hiding items in the drop-down lists for the fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="360134">PivotChart view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497154">PivotChart દૃશ્ય</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6540_8001_495243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Interactive or animated content used on the Internet. Active content includes ActiveX controls and web browser add-ons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="8001">active content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495243">સક્રિય સામગ્રી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6554_112160_1792453"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The paper that a publication is printed on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="112160">sheet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><l