e, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="502934">availability</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290045">સ્થિતિ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8570_502934_2327153"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A condition of a user that can be displayed to the user's contacts to communicate whether the user is currently online and available, offline and unavailable, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="502934">availability</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327153">ઉપલબ્ધતા</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8577_2408818_2412679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Information, such as name, phone number, email address, or address, that is used to contact someone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2408818">contact info</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2412679">સંપર્ક માહિતી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></nti