mmaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496896">બિલ્ડ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="952_36555_495448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To translate all the source code of a program from a high-level language into object code prior to execution of the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36555">compile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495448">કંપાઇલ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="952_36555_496896"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To translate all the source code of a program from a high-level language into object code prior to execution of the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36555">compile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496896">બિલ્ડ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9521_253747_2709174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account provided in a local domain for a user whose regular account is not in a trusted domain. A local account cannot be used to log on interactively. Further, a local account created in one domain cannot be used in a trusted domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="253747">local account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2709174">સ્થાનિક ખાતું</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9534_258951_496581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The degree of precision and exactness with which one entity represents another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="258951">fidelity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496581">ફિડેલિટી</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9536_61276_495637"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For a computer system, to be in an inactive state, but not shut off. When the computer is switched back on, the desktop is restored exactly as it was.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="61276">hibernate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="495637">હાયબરનેટ કરો</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9543_415057_1856730"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A member of a dimension whose value is calculated at run time by using an expression. Calculated member values can be derived from the values of other members.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415057">calculated member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1856730">ગણના કરેલ સદસ્ય</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9547_177819_496298"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A document that contains general release information and late changes. It is one of the deliverables leading to the release readiness approved milestone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="177819">release notes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496298">જાહેર નોંધ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9552_266832_1856712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A secondary data source that is accessible to users who fill out forms offline. When a user is online, data from the data source is stored on the user’s computer so that it can appear in controls when the form is offline.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="266832">offline data source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1856712">ઑફલાઇન ડેટા સ્રોત</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9555_139836_1215285"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field you can create. A custom field can be a blank, combination, or formula field.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139836">custom field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1215285">કસ્ટમ ફીલ્ડ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9561_179696_496310"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A selection technique that involves dragging out a bounding outline (also referred to as a marquee) to define the selected objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="179696">region selection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gu"><ntig><termGrp><term id="496310">ક્ષેત્ર ચયન</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></